<title>INDIA: India to sell 30 bln rupees 5-yr securities May 9.</title>
<headline>India to sell 30 bln rupees 5-yr securities May 9.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government will sell 30 billion rupees of five-year securities on May 9, an official statement said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The sale of dated securities will be in the form of stock to the public by auction, it said.</p>
<p>It said the auction would be conducted by the Reserve Bank of India on May 9. The government stock will be eligible for the ready-forward facility.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
